The seven Worker/Store cases use actual RocksDB-backed Source Apply. Only the CLOSED retry case is switched to v4; it persists NV20 channel through the accounted Store fixture, freezes the actual ordinary Claim, consumes it into PUBLISHING with Budget/results/frontier, and subsequently applies typed UNKNOWN with the exact v4 Admission history image. Other cases preserve v3 compatibility. Channel, credential, capability/materialization/Owner/tuple/time authorities are explicit fixtures; no physical credential or protection authority is certified. Protocol tests verify exact commitment/roundtrip, changed hash/payload/current Message rejection, body bounds, independent tuple and missing materialization authority.

Scope limit: this does not implement Producer/request construction, authenticated response/receipt/Journal matching, definitive/terminal/historical source Outcome, Native full timing template, production authority/proof retention, missing-Claim cold replay, Broker response loss or restart recovery. The frozen Claim proof is retained in the signed source body; recovery reconstruction is not implemented. E5 remains IN_PROGRESS / PENDING_CENTRAL_VALIDATION; productionAuthority/implementationComplete/centralValidationComplete remain false.

